# Kconfig overlay for the flagship_p4_barnacle env (platformio.ini), listed
# after sdkconfig.defaults in its SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS: nucleus-p4b, the Stamp-P4
# on the OSSM R+D board (src/Kconfig.projbuild NUCLEUS_BOARD_BARNACLE). The R+D
# board has no Modbus link to the drive.
CONFIG_NUCLEUS_BOARD_BARNACLE=y
# CONFIG_NUCLEUS_DRIVE_LINK is not set
